<!-- Pose Studio (#500) per-bone dial model: an exact port of the OP Pose HUD generator's
     rotate_quats_spherical() (owner's anim generator, src/Anim.c), with each bone's
     generator settings (bin/<bone>/gen_settings.txt). Generated by a one-off script from
     those files; regenerate rather than hand-edit.
       axis      twist axis: 0 = X, 1 = Y, 2 = Z
       leg       leg twist mitigation (y-dependent pre-rotation and twist compensation)
       pre       pre_rotate, degrees (eulerToQuaternion)
       base      rest rotation from the bone's input .anim, LL order x y z w (all identity today)
       offset    dial = generator angle + offset (the HUD's numbers)
       invert    sign the generator applied to each angle (the -ix/-iy/-iz flags, recovered by
                 matching every bone's generated .anim files)
       min/max   dial range (generator lower/upper + offset)
       steps     the HUD's resolutions (only used when snap is set to "Bone")
       followers joints that get the same rotation (invert 1 = conjugated), as in the input .anim
     "default" is used for every other bone: twist-axis-X spherical model, no pre-rotation,
     identity base, dial ranges +/-180. -->
